  title `The Central Road and Infrastructure Fund Act, 2000`
  localizedTitles obj_root_laws_the_central_road_and_infrastructure_fund_act_2000_localized_titles
  actNumber (54)
  actYear (2000)
  enactmentDate 2000-12-27
  ministry `Ministry of Finance`
  department `Department of Economic Affairs`
  longTitle `An Act to give statutory status to the existing Central Road Fund governed by the Resolution of Parliament passed in 1988, for development and maintenance of national highways and improvement of safety at railway crossings, and for these purposes to levy and collect by way of cess, a duty of excise and duty of customs on motor spirit commonly known as petrol, high speed diesel oil and for other matters connected therewith.`
  category property
  categoryTags obj_root_laws_the_central_road_and_infrastructure_fund_act_2000_category_tags
  sourceUrl `https://www.indiacode.nic.in/handle/123456789/1931`
