  enactmentDate 2013-09-18
  ministry `Ministry of Civil Aviation`
  department obj_root_laws_the_rajiv_gandhi_national_aviation_university_act_2013_department
  longTitle `An Act to establish and incorporate a national aviation University to facilitate and promote aviation studies and research to achieve excellence in areas of aviation management, policy, science and technology, aviation environment, training in governing fields of safety and security regulations on aviation and other related fields to produce quality human resources to cater to the needs of the aviation sector and to provide for matters connected therewith or incidental thereto.`
