  slug the-coal-mines-special-provisions-act-2015
  title `The Coal Mines (Special Provisions) Act, 2015`
  localizedTitles obj_root_laws_the_coal_mines_special_provisions_act_2015_localized_titles
  actNumber (11)
  actYear (2015)
  enactmentDate 2015-03-30
  ministry `Ministry of Coal`
  department obj_root_laws_the_coal_mines_special_provisions_act_2015_department
  longTitle `An Act to provide for allocation of coal mines and vesting of the right, title and interest in and over the land and mine infrastructure together with mining leases to successful bidders and allottees with a view to ensure continuity in coal mining operations and production of coal, and for promoting optimum utilisation of coal resources consistent with the requirement of the country in national interest and for matters connected therewith or incidental thereto.`
  category women
  categoryTags obj_root_laws_the_coal_mines_special_provisions_act_2015_category_tags
