  slug the-inland-vessels-act-2021
  title `The Inland Vessels Act, 2021`
  localizedTitles obj_root_laws_the_inland_vessels_act_2021_localized_titles
  actNumber (24)
  actYear (2021)
  enactmentDate 2021-08-11
  ministry `Ministry of Ports, Shipping and Waterways`
  department obj_root_laws_the_inland_vessels_act_2021_department
  longTitle `An Act to promote economical and safe transportation and trade through inland waters, to bring uniformity in application of law relating to inland waterways and navigation within the country, to provide for safety of navigation, protection of life and cargo, and prevention of pollution that may be caused by the use or navigation of inland vessels, to ensure transparency and accountability of administration of inland water transportation, to strengthen procedures governing the inland vessels, their construction, survey, registration, manning, navigation and such other matters connected therewith or incidental thereto.`
  category constitutional
  categoryTags obj_root_laws_the_inland_vessels_act_2021_category_tags
  sourceUrl `https://www.indiacode.nic.in/handle/123456789/17048`
  sources obj_root_laws_the_inland_vessels_act_2021_sources
